[{"id":"x:9273573134835712","platform":"x","post_id":"9273573134835712","published_at":"2010-11-29T15:52:46.000Z","text":"Congratulations to Evan Lysacek for being nominated SI sportsman of the year. He's a great guy, and he has my vote! #EvanForSI","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/9273573134835712","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:7504103261347840","platform":"x","post_id":"7504103261347840","published_at":"2010-11-24T18:41:32.000Z","text":"My best wishes to everyone for a Happy Thanksgiving!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/7504103261347840","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:7483813542232064","platform":"x","post_id":"7483813542232064","published_at":"2010-11-24T17:20:54.000Z","text":"Tomorrow night's episode of The Apprentice delivers excitement at QVC along with appearances by Isaac Mizrahi and Cathie Black. 10 pm on NBC","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/7483813542232064","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:7461789721698304","platform":"x","post_id":"7461789721698304","published_at":"2010-11-24T15:53:23.000Z","text":"Watch CNN tomorrow at 2 pm & 5 pm and on Friday at 7 pm & 11 pm for a Thanksgiving Special hosted by John King. I'll be a featured guest.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/7461789721698304","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:6759410504310784","platform":"x","post_id":"6759410504310784","published_at":"2010-11-22T17:22:23.000Z","text":"Staff Sgt. Salvatore A. Giunta received the Medal of Honor from Pres. Obama this month. It was a great honor to have him visit me today.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/6759410504310784","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:5307138364674048","platform":"x","post_id":"5307138364674048","published_at":"2010-11-18T17:11:35.000Z","text":"\"CNBC Titans: Donald Trump \" will be shown Friday Nov 19th at 9 pm and 1 am, Sunday 11/21 at 9 pm and 11/24 at 7 pm http://bit.ly/ckojPN","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/5307138364674048","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:5285497953853441","platform":"x","post_id":"5285497953853441","published_at":"2010-11-18T15:45:35.000Z","text":"We're getting down to the wire on The Apprentice--tune in tonight for some great action! 10 p.m. on NBC.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/5285497953853441","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:4257859944579073","platform":"x","post_id":"4257859944579073","published_at":"2010-11-15T19:42:07.000Z","text":"My interview last week with Greta van Susteren is available here in slightly abridged form. http://bit.ly/96ztOA Good info to know about.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/4257859944579073","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:2742379589144576","platform":"x","post_id":"2742379589144576","published_at":"2010-11-11T15:20:08.000Z","text":"Tonight's episode of The Apprentice has a big surprise at the top of the show -- don't miss it! 10 p.m. on NBC.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_